    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relinquished: Souls Asylum</strong> is a psychological horror game where you wake in a haunted house and must solve deadly puzzles to escape\u2014while surviving the horrors that roam inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 20-minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747690/extras/0518c65f9171e8e1f3744a6353e6f36f.poster.avif?t=1749577747\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747690/extras/0518c65f9171e8e1f3744a6353e6f36f.webm?t=1749577747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747690/extras/0518c65f9171e8e1f3744a6353e6f36f.mp4?t=1749577747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relinquished: Souls Asylum\u00a0</strong>is a psychological horror game where you wake up in a decaying, unfamiliar house with no memory of how you got there. The only way out? Solve the twisted puzzles hidden throughout its haunted halls and unlock the front door\u2014before something else finds you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic clues, survive relentless horrors including lurking zombies and grasping hands, and face off against a terrifying boss that guards the final escape. Each room holds a piece of the mystery... and a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape before the house consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person survival horror experience with exploration, puzzle-solving, light combat, and resource management mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retro-style FPS visuals reminiscent of early 2000s horror games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric puzzle-solving and key item exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Classic enemies like the undead and disembodied hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Save system with typewriters for that authentic survival horror tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relinquished: Souls Asylum</strong> is a psychological horror game where you wake in a haunted house and must solve deadly puzzles to escape\u2014while surviving the horrors that roam inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 20-minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747690/extras/0518c65f9171e8e1f3744a6353e6f36f.poster.avif?t=1749577747\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747690/extras/0518c65f9171e8e1f3744a6353e6f36f.webm?t=1749577747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747690/extras/0518c65f9171e8e1f3744a6353e6f36f.mp4?t=1749577747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relinquished: Souls Asylum\u00a0</strong>is a psychological horror game where you wake up in a decaying, unfamiliar house with no memory of how you got there. The only way out? Solve the twisted puzzles hidden throughout its haunted halls and unlock the front door\u2014before something else finds you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic clues, survive relentless horrors including lurking zombies and grasping hands, and face off against a terrifying boss that guards the final escape. Each room holds a piece of the mystery... and a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape before the house consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person survival horror experience with exploration, puzzle-solving, light combat, and resource management mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retro-style FPS visuals reminiscent of early 2000s horror games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric puzzle-solving and key item exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Classic enemies like the undead and disembodied hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Save system with typewriters for that authentic survival horror tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You wake up alone in a decaying house, with no memory of how you got there. The front door is locked\u2014and the only way out is through. Solve classic survival horror-style puzzles, fight off undead horrors, and survive long enough to escape... if you can.",
